      {
        "test": "TC-AP-04",
        "text": "R04, Pinch detection when cold: stop_latency_ms was 14 ms against a limit of <= 10 ms. reversal_mm passed at 158.0 mm. This is not new. It has failed on 10 of 10 nights, under both v1.2 and v1.3, and the limit was <= 10 on every night. Values over the history ran from 13.0 to 15.0 ms. Open defect DR-1001 (S1, 'Pinch reversal late at -30 °C') is linked. The run also logged that the temperature estimate at start was -22 C while the chamber was set to -30 C."
      },
      {
        "test": "TC-CAN-01",
        "text": "R09, WLC_Status timing and content: period_max_ms was 112 ms against the v1.3 limit of 45 to 55 ms. period_min_ms passed at 49 ms. This is a new failure tonight (1 failed night of 10). It passed on 2026-10-03, 2026-10-04 and 2026-10-05 at 52.0, 51.0 and 52.0 ms. The log shows a 112 ms gap between t=6383 and t=6495 ms, and a frame was probably skipped. No open defect is linked."
      },
      {
        "test": "TC-TH-03",
        "text": "R10, Opening blocked when hot: two criteria failed. max_current_above_130C_a was 15.16 A against a limit of <= 15 A. There were 13 samples above 15 A while the estimate was above 130 C. The first was at t=39110 ms at 134.0 C, and they are described as end-stop stalls. opening_starts_above_140C was 1 against a limit of 0. Opening started at t=57050 ms at 143.9 C, and the controller completed full opening travel above 140 C with no inhibit. closing_possible_above_140C passed at 2 movements. This is not new. It has failed on 10 of 10 nights, under v1.2 and v1.3 with the same limit of no opening above 140. The opening-start temperature ran from 140.8 to 143.9 C over the history. Open defect DR-1012 (S3, 'Opening possible above 140 °C') is linked."
      }
    ],
